---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout {...{"title": "Hide and Seek Day Camp | Christian Summer Day Camp in Canton, GA", "description": "A Christ rooted day camp for finished kindergarten through finished fifth grade, open to every family. Eight weeks of summer, three campuses, and counselors who know your child by name.", "path": "/"}}>
<Fragment slot="hero">
<div class="hero-home">
    <picture><source media="(max-width:600px)" srcset="/img/home-header-3.webp"><img src="/img/gallery-dsc00345.webp" alt="Campers sitting together smiling outside" style="object-position:50% 100%;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover"></picture>
    <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(115% 72% at 18% 100%,rgba(36,91,131,.62) 0%,rgba(36,91,131,0) 64%),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(11,38,60,.56) 0%,rgba(11,38,60,.14) 58%,transparent 100%),linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,38,60,.72) 0%,rgba(11,38,60,.22) 26%,rgba(10,34,54,.52) 52%,rgba(8,28,45,.93) 82%,rgba(8,28,45,.97) 100%)"></div>
    <div style="position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:0 clamp(20px,3vw,40px) 64px">
      <div class="wrap" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:56px;align-items:end">
        <div>
          <p style="margin:0 0 18px;color:#9fcbe8;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase">Canton, Georgia &middot; Our 18th summer</p>
          <h1 style="margin:0;color:#fff;font-size:68px;line-height:1.02;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:15ch;text-wrap:pretty">A safe place for a summer of real <span style="color:#dda527">outdoor fun</span></h1>
        </div>
        <div style="padding-bottom:8px">
          <p style="margin:0 0 22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.94);font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;max-width:46ch">A Christ centered day camp for finished kindergarten through finished fifth grade, open to every family. Eight weeks of summer, three campuses, and counselors who know your child by name.</p>
          <div class="row"><a href="https://www.ultracamp.com/clientlogin.aspx?idCamp=307&amp;campcode=hns&amp;lang=en-Us" data-ev="register_click" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gold" style="padding:15px 30px">Register for a session</a><a href="/parent-info/dates-hours-pricing/" class="ghostL">See dates and pricing</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Fragment>
  <div class="sec" style="padding-bottom:0"><div class="wrap g4">
    <div><div style="margin-bottom:18px"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" fill="#71add9" fill-opacity=".35"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" fill="#dda527"/><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div><p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1">K to 5th</p><p class="s">Finished kindergarten through finished fifth grade, plus one middle school week</p></div>
    <div><div style="margin-bottom:18px"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#71add9" fill-opacity=".35"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14" stroke="#dda527"/></svg></div><p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1">9 to 3</p><p class="s">Monday to Friday in June and July, with early drop off and late pick up</p></div>
    <div><div style="margin-bottom:18px"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0" fill="#71add9" fill-opacity=".35"/><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" fill="#dda527" stroke="#dda527"/></svg></div><p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1">3 sites</p><p class="s">Hickory Flat, Ball Ground, and Sixes, all in Cherokee County</p></div>
    <div><div style="margin-bottom:18px"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" fill="#dda527" stroke="#dda527"/><path d="M12 2v2"/><path d="M12 20v2"/><path d="m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"/><path d="m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"/><path d="M2 12h2"/><path d="M20 12h2"/><path d="m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"/><path d="m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"/></svg></div><p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:34px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1">18 years</p><p class="s">Eighteen summers of camp, run by the non profit Seek Ministries</p></div>
  </div></div>

  <div class="sec"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">The camp experience</p>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:56px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:44px">
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin:0;max-width:20ch">What a day at camp actually feels like</h2>
      <p class="p" style="margin:0;max-width:64ch">Mornings open with a camp assembly to jump start the day. Rotations through the woods, the field, and the craft tables are highlighted with Bible study. Small groups are led by intentional counselors that truly care about their campers. One day of the week is water day and Friday is open woods.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="g3">
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:300px"><img src="/img/home-01.webp" alt="Camper in a harness climbing in the trees"></div><h3 class="h3" style="margin-top:22px">Outdoor adventure</h3><p class="s">Zipline, rock wall, gaga ball, ninja island, low ropes, 9 square, and field games all week long.</p></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:300px"><img src="/img/home-02.webp" alt="Three boys smiling together indoors" style="object-position:50% 35%"></div><h3 class="h3" style="margin-top:22px">Friendship and belonging</h3><p class="s">Groups of eight, led by a trained counselor who stays with your camper every day of the session.</p></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:300px"><img src="/img/home-03.webp" alt="Camper praying with hands folded" style="object-position:50% 40%"></div><h3 class="h3" style="margin-top:22px">Bible teaching</h3><p class="s">Matthew 6:33 and Psalm 119:11 shape our summer, with a curriculum taught by staff who love your kids.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="row" style="margin-top:36px"><a href="/explore-camp/camp-experience/" class="navy">See the camp experience</a></div>
  </div></div>

  <div class="sec" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center">
    <p class="eyebrow">What campers do all day</p>
    <h2 class="h2" style="margin:0 auto 48px;max-width:18ch">Big outdoor things, every single day</h2>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:22px">
      <div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m2 9 20-5"/><path d="M10 3h.01"/><path d="M14 2h.01"/><path d="M12 12V6.5"/><rect width="16" height="10" x="4" y="12" rx="3" fill="#dda527"/><rect width="16" height="10" x="4" y="12" rx="3"/><path d="M9 12v5"/><path d="M15 12v5"/><path d="M4 17h16"/></svg></div><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Zipline</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#5c5348">Across the field, all week</p></div>
      <div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m8 3 4 8 5-5 5 15H2L8 3z" fill="#71add9" fill-opacity=".4"/><path d="m8 3 4 8 5-5 5 15H2L8 3z"/><path d="m8 3 4 8-4 2-3-2z" fill="#dda527" stroke="none"/></svg></div><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Rock wall</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#5c5348">Belayed by a counselor</p></div>
      <div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z" fill="#71add9" fill-opacity=".35"/><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.6" fill="#dda527" stroke="#dda527"/></svg></div><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Gaga ball</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#5c5348">The pit is never empty</p></div>
      <div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 6c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1C7 7 7 5 9.5 5c2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1"/><path d="M2 12c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1" stroke="#dda527"/><path d="M2 18c.6.5 1.2 1 2.5 1 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 2.6 0 2.4 2 5 2 2.5 0 2.5-2 5-2 1.3 0 1.9.5 2.5 1" stroke="#71add9"/></svg></div><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Ninja island</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#5c5348">Low ropes in the woods</p></div>
      <div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.93 0 1.65-.75 1.65-1.69 0-.44-.18-.84-.44-1.13-.29-.29-.44-.65-.44-1.12a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.67-1.67h2c3.05 0 5.55-2.5 5.55-5.55C22 6.01 17.5 2 12 2z" fill="#71add9" fill-opacity=".3"/><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.93 0 1.65-.75 1.65-1.69 0-.44-.18-.84-.44-1.13-.29-.29-.44-.65-.44-1.12a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.67-1.67h2c3.05 0 5.55-2.5 5.55-5.55C22 6.01 17.5 2 12 2z"/><circle cx="6.6" cy="12.6" r="1.3" fill="#dda527" stroke="none"/><circle cx="8.6" cy="7.6" r="1.3" fill="#dda527" stroke="none"/><circle cx="13.4" cy="6.6" r="1.3" fill="#dda527" stroke="none"/><circle cx="17.4" cy="10.4" r="1.3" fill="#dda527" stroke="none"/></svg></div><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Arts and crafts</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#5c5348">Plus the bracelet station</p></div>
      <div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5C6 11.1 5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z" fill="#71add9" fill-opacity=".55"/><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5C6 11.1 5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"/><circle cx="9.6" cy="15.4" r="1.9" fill="#dda527" stroke="none"/></svg></div><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Water day</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#5c5348">Every Thursday, send a towel</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <div class="navyband" style="padding:88px clamp(20px,3vw,40px);border-radius:36px 36px 0 0"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#dda527">Camp options</p>
    <h2 class="h2" style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:44px;max-width:22ch">Three ways to come to camp</h2>
    <div class="g3">
      <div style="background:#fbf7ef;border-radius:24px;padding:14px 14px 26px;color:#20180f">
        <div class="ph" style="height:230px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:22px"><img src="/img/home-04.webp" alt="Campers standing on a stick fort in the woods" style="object-position:50% 45%"></div>
        <div style="padding:0 12px"><h3 class="h3">Summer Day Camp</h3><p class="s" style="margin-bottom:18px">Finished kindergarten through finished fifth grade. Six weekly sessions, 9 a.m. to 3 p.m.</p><div class="row" style="margin-bottom:20px"><span class="chip">$275 per week</span><span class="chip">All three campuses</span></div><a href="/explore-camp/summer-day-camp/" class="lk">Learn more</a></div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fbf7ef;border-radius:24px;padding:14px 14px 26px;color:#20180f">
        <div class="ph" style="height:230px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:22px"><img src="/img/home-05.webp" alt="Large group of campers in matching purple shirts in the woods"></div>
        <div style="padding:0 12px"><h3 class="h3">SEEK Adventure</h3><p class="s" style="margin-bottom:18px">One week for finished sixth, seventh, and eighth grade. Bigger activities, more woods.</p><div class="row" style="margin-bottom:20px"><span class="chip">$300 for the week</span><span class="chip">Hickory Flat only</span></div><a href="/explore-camp/seek-adventure/" class="lk">Learn more</a></div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fbf7ef;border-radius:24px;padding:14px 14px 26px;color:#20180f">
        <div class="ph" style="height:230px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:22px"><img src="/img/home-06.webp" alt="Camper working on a string craft" style="object-position:50% 90%"></div>
        <div style="padding:0 12px"><h3 class="h3">Winter Camp</h3><p class="s" style="margin-bottom:18px">A daily camp between Christmas and New Year's for families needing childcare and for campers who miss camp.</p><div class="row" style="margin-bottom:20px"><span class="chip">$55 a day</span><span class="chip">December 29, 30, 31</span></div><a href="/explore-camp/winter-camp/" class="lk">Learn more</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <div class="sec" style="padding-top:96px"><div class="wrap" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.05fr);gap:64px;align-items:center">
    <div style="position:relative">
      <div class="ph" style="height:520px;border-radius:26px"><img src="/img/home-07.webp" alt="Camper at the top of the crate stack in the woods"></div>
      <div style="position:absolute;left:-22px;top:56px;background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:13px 22px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(32,24,15,.14);font-size:13px;font-weight:600">Background checked staff</div>
      <div style="position:absolute;right:-18px;top:210px;background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:13px 22px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(32,24,15,.14);font-size:13px;font-weight:600">Groups of eight</div>
      <div style="position:absolute;left:26px;bottom:-20px;background:#dda527;border-radius:999px;padding:13px 22px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(32,24,15,.16);font-size:13px;font-weight:600">Certified ropes training</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Why parents choose us</p>
      <h2 class="h2" style="max-width:20ch">You should not have to worry all day</h2>
      <p class="p" style="margin-bottom:32px;max-width:48ch">Most of our families use camp because they work. That means the bar is not entertainment, it is trust. Here is how we earn it.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:30px 32px">
        <div><div style="margin-bottom:14px"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z" fill="#71add9" fill-opacity=".35"/><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" stroke="#dda527"/></svg></div><h3 style="margin:0 0 7px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em">Safe</h3><p class="s">Background checks, several references, counselor training, and third party ropes course certification before camp starts.</p></div>
        <div><div style="margin-bottom:14px"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7z" fill="#dda527" fill-opacity=".45"/><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7z"/></svg></div><h3 style="margin:0 0 7px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em">Cared for</h3><p class="s">Small groups and one counselor who stays with your camper all week, so someone always knows how the day went.</p></div>
        <div><div style="margin-bottom:14px"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12.59 2.59A2 2 0 0 0 11.17 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.17a2 2 0 0 0 .59 1.42l8.7 8.7a2.43 2.43 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.43 2.43 0 0 0 0-3.42z" fill="#71add9" fill-opacity=".35"/><path d="M12.59 2.59A2 2 0 0 0 11.17 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.17a2 2 0 0 0 .59 1.42l8.7 8.7a2.43 2.43 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.43 2.43 0 0 0 0-3.42z"/><circle cx="7.4" cy="7.4" r="1.5" fill="#dda527" stroke="none"/></svg></div><h3 style="margin:0 0 7px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em">Affordable</h3><p class="s">$275 a week, with early drop off from 7:30 a.m. and post camp until 6 p.m. for working parents.</p></div>
        <div><div style="margin-bottom:14px"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#245b83" stroke-width="2.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 7a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3z" fill="#dda527" fill-opacity=".45"/><path d="M12 7v14"/><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"/></svg></div><h3 style="margin:0 0 7px;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em">Christ rooted</h3><p class="s">Rooted in the gospel and open to everyone. You do not need to belong to a church to belong at camp.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <div class="sec" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:40px;margin-bottom:40px">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Camp locations</p><h2 class="h2" style="margin:0;max-width:22ch">Three campuses across Cherokee County</h2></div>
      <a href="/locations/" class="ghostD" style="white-space:nowrap">All locations</a>
    </div>
    <div class="g3">
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:280px"><img src="/img/home-09.webp" alt="Campers and counselors posing for a group photo"><span style="position:absolute;top:16px;left:16px;background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600">Largest campus</span></div><h3 class="h3" style="margin-top:20px">Hickory Flat</h3><p class="s" style="margin-bottom:14px">Mt. Zion Baptist Church<br>4096 East Cherokee Drive, Canton</p><a href="/locations/hickory-flat/" class="lk">Directions and carpool</a></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:280px"><img src="/img/home-10.webp" alt="Campers and counselors together on the grass"></div><h3 class="h3" style="margin-top:20px">Ball Ground</h3><p class="s" style="margin-bottom:14px">Ball Ground Methodist Church<br>3045 Canton Hwy, Ball Ground</p><a href="/locations/ball-ground/" class="lk">Directions and carpool</a></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:280px"><img src="/img/home-11.webp" alt="Camper cheering with both arms in the air"></div><h3 class="h3" style="margin-top:20px">Sixes</h3><p class="s" style="margin-bottom:14px">8385 Bells Ferry Road<br>Canton, GA 30114</p><a href="/locations/sixes/" class="lk">Directions and carpool</a></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>

  <div class="tint" style="padding:88px clamp(20px,3vw,40px)"><div class="wrap">
